<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">

<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">

<style>

body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #f4f4f4;
  text-align: center;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 20px;
}

.cabecalho {
  max-width: 500px;
  margin: auto;
  background: #222;
  color: white;
  padding: 15px;
  border-radius: 10px;
}

h1 {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 34px;
}

h2 {
  font-size: 22px;
  margin: 25px 0;
}

.cartao {
  width: 340px;
  height: 410px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  perspective: 1000px;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.cartao-interno {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  position: relative;
  transition: transform 0.7s;
  transform-style: preserve-3d;
}

.cartao.virado .cartao-interno {
  transform: rotateY(180deg);
}

.cartao-frente,
.cartao-verso {
  position: absolute;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  backface-visibility: hidden;
  border-radius: 18px;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
}

.cartao-frente {
  background: white;
  color: #222;
}

.cartao-verso {
  background: #222;
  color: white;
  transform: rotateY(180deg);
}

.cartao-imagem {
  width: 100%;
  height: 260px;
  object-fit: cover;
}

.cartao p {
  font-size: 19px;
  line-height: 1.35;
  padding: 12px 18px;
}

.cartao-verso strong {
  color: #ff5252;
  font-size: 25px;
}

.dica {
  margin-top: 15px;
  font-weight: bold;
  color: #555;
}

footer {
  margin-top: 25px;
  color: #555;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<header class="cabecalho">
  <h1>Confere Aí</h1>
</header>

<main>

  <h2>Mito ou verdade?</h2>

  <article class="cartao" onclick="this.classList.toggle('virado')">

    <div class="cartao-interno">

      <div class="cartao-frente">

        <img
          src="https://static.nationalgeographicbrasil.com/files/styles/image_3200/public/mm1012723121410486.jpg?w=1900&amp;h=2849"
          alt="Pinguins"
          class="cartao-imagem"
        >

        <p>
          Mito ou verdade:<br>
          <strong>TÍTULO DA PERGUNTA AQUI</strong>
        </p>

      </div>

      <div class="cartao-verso">

        <img
          src="https://static.nationalgeographicbrasil.com/files/styles/image_3200/public/mm1012723121410486.jpg?w=1900&amp;h=2849"
          alt="Pinguins"
          class="cartao-imagem"
        >

        <p>
          <strong>Mito!</strong><br>
          TÍTULO DA MENTIRA AQUI
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>

  </article>

  <p class="dica">
    👆 Clique no cartão para virar
  </p>

</main>

<footer>
  Projeto feito por SEU NOME AQUI
</footer>

</body>
</html>
